### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000
@api = {{baseUrl}}/api


### ============================================================
### Health check
### ============================================================
GET {{baseUrl}}/health


### ============================================================
### Swagger docs (open in browser)
### ============================================================
# {{baseUrl}}/api/docs


### ============================================================
### SERVICES
### ============================================================

### Create service
POST {{api}}/services
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----Boundary

------Boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="title"

Project Management Consultancy
------Boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="description"

Comprehensive consultancy services covering every phase of project delivery.
------Boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="keyCapabilities[]"

Project Planning
------Boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="keyCapabilities[]"

Cost Control
------Boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="image"; filename="service.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./sample.jpg
------Boundary--

### Get all services (paginated)
GET {{api}}/services?page=1&limit=10

### Search services
GET {{api}}/services?search=consultancy

### Get service by ID
# @name service
GET {{api}}/services/{{SERVICE_ID}}

### Update service (replace image)
PUT {{api}}/services/{{SERVICE_ID}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----Boundary

------Boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="title"

Updated Consultancy Title
------Boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="image"; filename="new-service.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./sample.jpg
------Boundary--

### Delete service
DELETE {{api}}/services/{{SERVICE_ID}}


### ============================================================
### JOBS
### ============================================================

### Create job
POST {{api}}/jobs
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "designation": "Site Engineer",
  "jobTitle": "Senior Site Engineer",
  "location": "Delhi",
  "employmentType": "Full Time",
  "jobDescription": "Responsible for project execution at the site.",
  "requirements": ["B.Tech Civil", "3+ Years Experience", "AutoCAD Knowledge"]
}

### Get all jobs (paginated)
GET {{api}}/jobs

### Filter jobs by employment type
GET {{api}}/jobs?employmentType=Full%20Time

### Search jobs
GET {{api}}/jobs?search=engineer

### Get job by ID
GET {{api}}/jobs/{{JOB_ID}}

### Update job
PUT {{api}}/jobs/{{JOB_ID}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "location": "Mumbai"
}

### Delete job
DELETE {{api}}/jobs/{{JOB_ID}}


### ============================================================
### PROJECTS
### ============================================================

### Create project (with hero + gallery images)
POST {{api}}/projects
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----Boundary

------Boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="projectTitle"

NH-44 Highway Widening
------Boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="location"

Delhi - Agra, Uttar Pradesh
------Boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="clientName"

National Highways Authority of India
------Boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="projectValue"

INR 1,250 Crores
------Boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="category"

Infrastructure
------Boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="status"

Completed
------Boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="projectDescription"

Major highway widening project covering 200 km.
------Boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="featured"

true
------Boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="projectImage"; filename="hero.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./sample.jpg
------Boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="projectImages"; filename="gallery1.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./sample.jpg
------Boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="projectImages"; filename="gallery2.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./sample.jpg
------Boundary--

### Get all projects (paginated)
GET {{api}}/projects

### Filter projects by status
GET {{api}}/projects?status=Completed

### Filter projects by category
GET {{api}}/projects?category=Infrastructure

### Filter featured projects
GET {{api}}/projects?featured=true

### Search projects
GET {{api}}/projects?search=highway

### Get project by ID
GET {{api}}/projects/{{PROJECT_ID}}

### Update project (add new gallery images)
PUT {{api}}/projects/{{PROJECT_ID}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----Boundary

------Boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="status"

Ongoing
------Boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="projectImages"; filename="new-gallery.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./sample.jpg
------Boundary--

### Delete project
DELETE {{api}}/projects/{{PROJECT_ID}}


### ============================================================
### ABOUT US
### ============================================================

### Get About (auto-creates on first request)
GET {{api}}/about

### Update About
PUT {{api}}/about
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Building India's Future",
  "description": "Engineering and infrastructure excellence.",
  "mission": "Deliver world-class infrastructure.",
  "vision": "Transform India's future.",
  "values": ["Integrity", "Innovation", "Quality"]
}


### ============================================================
### CAREER APPLICATIONS
### ============================================================

### Apply for a job (upload resume)
POST {{api}}/careers/apply
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----Boundary

------Boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="fullName"

aayush4 Doe
------Boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="email"

john@example.com
------Boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="phoneNumber"

9876543210
------Boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="positionAppliedFor"

Senior Site Engineer
------Boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="yearsOfExperience"

5 Years
------Boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="coverLetter"

I would like to join your company.
------Boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="resume"; filename="resume.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< ./sample.pdf
------Boundary--

### Get all applications (paginated)
GET {{api}}/careers

### Search applications
GET {{api}}/careers?search=john

### Get application by ID
GET {{api}}/careers/6a368bf3e75c0871d2b4d720

### Delete application (also removes resume from Cloudinary)
DELETE {{api}}/careers/{{CAREER_ID}}


### ============================================================
### CONTACT FORM
### ============================================================

### Submit contact form
POST {{api}}/contact
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Aarav Sharma",
  "email": "aarav@example.com",
  "phone": "9876543210",
  "subject": "Partnership enquiry",
  "message": "We are an equipment supplier interested in partnering."
}

### Get all contacts (paginated)
GET {{api}}/contact?page=1&limit=10

### Search contacts
GET {{api}}/contact?search=partnership

### Get contact by ID
GET {{api}}/contact/{{CONTACT_ID}}

### Delete contact
DELETE {{api}}/contact/{{CONTACT_ID}}


### ============================================================
### DASHBOARD STATISTICS
### ============================================================

### Get dashboard stats
GET {{api}}/dashboard/stats
